  "description": "E-Cozy Electric Trike for Seniors and Everyday Comfort\nThe VTUVIA E-Cozy combines a relaxed riding position, supportive backrest, torque sensor technology, and three-wheel stability to create one of the most comfortable electric trikes for seniors and adults. Whether you're heading to the farmer’s market, walking the dog, exploring your neighborhood, or enjoying an RV adventure, E-Cozy helps you ride with confidence and comfort.\nWhat Makes the E-Cozy Different?\nUnlike traditional electric bikes that require more balance and a forward-leaning riding position, the VTUVIA E-Cozy is designed around comfort and confidence.\nIts forward-pedaling design allows riders to sit in a more relaxed position while reducing pressure on the knees, hips, and lower back. Combined with a supportive backrest, torque sensor system, reverse function, and stable three-wheel platform, E-Cozy delivers a smooth and comfortable riding experience for seniors, retirees, and adults looking for a safer alternative to a traditional bicycle.",
